{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working at a flower shop was supposed to be peaceful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something here feels\u2026 off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>My Lovely Flower</i> is a PS1-style horror experience. You run a small flower shop, grow blooms in the backyard, and prepare bouquets for the strange people who come through the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every order, something unravels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s like the soil is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And each morning, the town feels a little quieter.<br><br><strong>-New customers and new oddities every day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/cea40345c4eb7fff2e40a87c45994217.webp?t=1761601106\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/cea40345c4eb7fff2e40a87c45994217.poster.webp?t=1761601106\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Grow your flowers in your greenhouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/596471a19fdcde161c87c6a76d969a64.webp?t=1761601106\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/596471a19fdcde161c87c6a76d969a64.poster.webp?t=1761601106\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/5f4091d8955b73e10cf7f505a3da0432.webp?t=1761601106\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834530/extras/5f4091d8955b73e10cf7f505a3da0432.poster.webp?t=1761601106\" class=\"bb_img\" 